.TH SANCHALA-PRIVACY 1 "August 2026" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-privacy \- Privacy management center for Sanchala OS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-privacy
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fICOMMAND\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sanchala-privacy
provides centralized privacy controls including telemetry settings,
location services, camera/microphone access, and tracker blocking.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B status
Show privacy status overview
.TP
.B dashboard
Open privacy dashboard
.TP
.B telemetry \fR[\fBon\fR|\fBoff\fR|\fBstatus\fR]
Manage telemetry settings
.TP
.B location \fR[\fBon\fR|\fBoff\fR|\fBstatus\fR]
Manage location services
.TP
.B trackers
Show blocked trackers statistics
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output in JSON format
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help message
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/sanchala/privacy/privacy.toml
System privacy settings
.TP
.I ~/.config/sanchala/privacy.toml
User privacy preferences
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sanchala-guardian (1),
.BR sanchala-permissions (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Sanchala OS Team <dev@sanchala.id>
